WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.995 --> 00:00:10.603
Cockpit opens in a fresh browser with an empty board. This is the actual local application, without private tasks or existing work logs.

2
00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:20.033
I create a fictional website review task and give it a concrete next action. Saving places that task on the real board.

3
00:00:21.236 --> 00:00:31.794
I search for the sample website task. The board filters the visible cards, showing how a small team can find the next piece of work without an account or a server.
